## Important scientific principle

The final implementation must follow this rule:

> Use chemical similarity to retrieve candidate co-crystal ligands, but select the final PDB using a combination of ligand similarity, binding-mode similarity, target mapping, active-site compatibility, structural quality, and docking/MD suitability.

The purpose of this extension is not simply to replace `7MYI` and `5MCQ` with arbitrary similar structures. The purpose is to create an explainable, target-aware, reproducible structure-selection system that improves docking and MD template selection while preserving the existing validated BACE1 workflows.
